----------------------------------

MIT License
Copyright (c) 2026 Royal Bhati

Ported to Rust in this project:

  crates/ddl/src/scan.rs   — the span-preserving scanning strategy from
                             src/parser.js: blanking comments to equal-length
                             whitespace so byte offsets stay valid, splitting
                             statements and clause lists at top level only, and
                             carrying a byte span on every identifier token.
  crates/ddl/src/stmt.rs   — the statement and clause recognition it drives.
  crates/layout/src/lib.rs — the hub-aware edge weighting from src/layout.js.
