Test fixtures
-------------

fixtures/real/ holds two schemas dumped by `pg_dump` and `mysqldump` for other
people's purposes. They are here precisely because we did not write them: a
fixture we author can only confirm what we already believe. Both found real
defects the first time they were parsed.

